    "reason": "The computed CRD diff between [ev-30934c6c9b63] (v1.20.1) and [ev-6e79b5dc61ae] (v2.0.0) shows that the enum for CompositionRevision v1 spec.mode lost \"Resources\" and gained no values. A deterministic validator confirmed this. The API server rejects only objects that still carry the removed value. So a CompositionRevision with spec.mode equal to \"Resources\" is exactly the exposed state. The canonical check of \"the field is set\" would be too broad, because it would also flag revisions that use values the schema still allows.",
